<title>UK: Oil firms agree Elgin field interests - Hardy.</title>
<headline>Oil firms agree Elgin field interests - Hardy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hardy Oil &amp; Gas Plc on Wednesday said it and other oil and gas production firms reached agreement on working interests for a single unit area covering the North Sea Elgin and Franklin gas fields.</p>
<p>The agreed working interest entitlements are as follows:</p>
<p> Elf Exploration UK PLC				46.173 pct</p>
<p> Agip (U.K.) Limited				   13.867</p>
<p>British Gas Exploration and Production Limited 12.350</p>
<p> Hardy Exploration &amp; Production Limited	   8.000</p>
<p> Ruhrgas UK Exploration and Production Limited  5.200</p>
<p> Shell U.K. Limited				     4.375</p>
<p> Esso Exploration and Production Limited	  4.375</p>
<p> Texaco Britain Limited				 3.900</p>
<p> ARCO British Limited				   1.760</p>
<p>The Elgin and Franklin gas field are operated by Elf Exploration UK.</p>
</text>
